    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8547" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clausūra</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clūsūra</span></b> , ae, f.
		claudo. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> (Cf.
			claustra, I. A.) <i>A lock</i>, <i>bar</i>, <i>bolt</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
				Orell. 2510</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> (Cf. claustra, II. B.) <i>A castle</i>, <i>fort</i> (late
			Lat.), <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 1, 27, 2, §
			4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 2, 5</span></i>.</div>
